  "description": "Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for Silueta. De-identifies conversation transcripts by file path, so a transcript can be analysed without the identified text ever passing through a model's context; also explains why the phonetic matcher did or did not match two names, and lists the pattern rules. Runs entirely on the machine and never re-identifies.",
